  "full_response": "When creating a customer complaint email, it's important to maintain privacy and security. As such, personal information such as full names, order numbers, home addresses, email addresses, and phone numbers should not be shared in open forums. Below is a template for a customer complaint email, with placeholders for sensitive information:\n\n---\n\nSubject: Customer Complaint - Order #[Order_Number]\n\nDear [Customer Service Team/Specific Contact Name],\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to express my concern regarding a recent purchase from your store. Below are the details for your reference:\n\n- **Order Number**: [Order_Number]\n- **Email Address**: [Your_Email_Address]\n- **Phone Number**: [Your_Phone_Number]\n\nI placed the order on [Order_Date] and received it on [Delivery_Date]. However, I encountered the following issues:\n\n1. **Description of the Problem**: [Provide a detailed description of the issue, e.g., \"The item received was damaged upon arrival,\" or \"The product delivered is different from what I ordered.\")\n\n2. **Impact**: [Explain how this issue is affecting you, such as \"I am unable to use the product as intended\" or \"I had an urgent need for the item, and this delay has caused inconvenience.\")\n\nIn light of the above, I would appreciate it if you could:\n\n- [List any specific actions you would like the company to take, e.g., \"Please arrange for a replacement of the item at the earliest convenience,\" or \"I would like assistance with processing a refund for this order.\")\n\nI have attached photographs and any other relevant documentation, if necessary, to support my claim.\n\nThank you for your prompt attention to this matter. I look forward to your reply and a satisfactory resolution.\n\nWarm regards,\n\n[Your Full Name]\n\n---\n\nMake sure to only include personal information where absolutely necessary for addressing the issue, and always follow privacy guidelines when sharing information electronically.",
